From 78ea9051a50fdd31c7b71671ae910734601f6065 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <168627+NeoTech@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:37:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(pathkernel): the old-planner baseline of each
 phase-1 kind

Record the output of the old planners on side/path-kernel for the 15
phase-1 kinds that had no baseline, in the #3750 form (CL text at 1 um,
one note line for each note; the app pin adds the verifier warnings).

- Motion level: 15 pins in pass_start_levels/kernel_baseline/ (Face,
  2D Contour, 2D Adaptive spiral and trochoidal, Engrave, V-Carve,
  2D Chamfer, Circular, Slot, Trochoidal slot, Trace, Slot Undercut,
  Thread, Bore, 3D Pocket), 90 goldens kernel_<kind>_<case>.cl.
- App level: the 2D Pocket on fig8.step, 5 cases, heavy lane with a
  light twin, goldens kernel_pocket2d_fig8_<case>.cl.

No planner code and no existing golden changes.

Refs #4153

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
