Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(cl): round-trip the CL text of an annotated golden

The baseline goldens of #4153 end with `; note:` and `; warning:`
lines. The round-trip test reads only the CL text before them. The
hunk is byte-identical to the one of PR #4123 (#4055), so the two
branches merge cleanly in either order.

Refs #4153

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
